        <mxCell id="tp2" value="then, in order:&lt;br&gt;• suppress_official hit → &lt;b&gt;REJECT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• conf &amp;lt; immediate (0.90) → &lt;b&gt;REVIEW&lt;/b&gt; third_party_low_confidence&lt;br&gt;• invalid batch → &lt;b&gt;REVIEW&lt;/b&gt; third_party_missing_batch&lt;br&gt;• else → &lt;b&gt;ACCEPT&lt;/b&gt; EARLY_YC_LAUNCH (gpt_new_company_report:*)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="p2-1">
