        <mxCell id="rv4" value="&lt;b&gt;REVIEW&lt;/b&gt; gpt_review:{reason | needs_review}&lt;br&gt;confidence band [0.65, 0.90)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="p2-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="1845" width="400" height="65" as="geometry" />
